& [Constructive]
  + a closed nine-coordinate packet gives future operator tooling one deterministic handoff vocabulary
  + coordinate-specific verifier profiles expose the exact later work instead of hiding it in a generic authorize flag
  + opaque metadata prevents generic intake from becoming a secret-bearing transport

& [Adversarial]
  + an attacker may label nonexistent material externally supplied or give a digest size reference and verifier that look plausible
  + a complete packet may tempt consumers to infer readiness authority or current validity
  + private key or permit bytes may be laundered through reference or text fields

& [Reconciliation]
  + output admits shape only never authentication and retains all nine unresolved authorities
  + strict bounded safe text rejects control material and semantic allowlists reject field substitution
  + later verifiers and actual material transports remain separate signed seams
